---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import eroticImage from "@assets/images/erotic/elevate.png";
import coin1 from "@assets/images/erotic/coin1.png";
import coin2 from "@assets/images/erotic/coin2.png";
import logo from "@assets/images/erotic/railgunLogo.png";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/reset.scss" />
    <meta
      property="og:image"
      content="https://lel.nekoweb.org/images/erotic/ogHeader.webp"
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Toaru kagaku no Railgun" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="I like toaru" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://lel.nekoweb.org/erotic/" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Lel@Nekoweb" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#e3021f" />

    <link rel="sitemap" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />

    <link
      rel="preload"
      href="/fonts/IBMPlexSans-Light.ttf"
      as="font"
      type="font/ttf"
      crossorigin
    />
    <link
      rel="preload"
      href="/fonts/Gloock-Regular.ttf"
      as="font"
      type="font/ttf"
      crossorigin
    />

    <title>Erotic Page</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="title">
          <h1>A Certain Scientific<br /><span class="big">RAILGUN</span></h1>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Image
        src={eroticImage}
        alt="Erotic"
        class="erotic"
        width={750}
        height={750}
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="logo">
        <div class="coins">
          <Image
            src={coin1}
            alt="Coin front"
            height={100}
            width={100}
            loading="eager"
          />
          <Image
            src={coin2}
            alt="Coin back"
            height={100}
            width={100}
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
        <Image
          src={logo}
          alt="Railgun Anime logo"
          height={200}
          width={200}
          loading="eager"
          class="main-logo"
        />
      </div>
      <hr />
      <p>
        Academy City is a highly developed place in terms of technology. It is
        said to be 20 to 30 years ahead of the rest of the world, and 80% of its
        2.3 million residents are students. The focus of studies here is
        directed towards esper powers. Misaka Mikoto, one of the top level
        espers in town, shares a room with Kuroko Shirai, another high level
        esper who is a member of Judgement, a law enforcing agency composed of
        students. Both attend Tokiwadai, a private school reserved for the
        high-leveled and the rich. Kuroko's partner at Judgement, Kazari Uiharu,
        is a low level esper who studies at Sakugawa middle school. Her best
        friend and classmate there is Ruiko Saten, a level zero, one who has no
        esper powers. Together, the four encounter several adventures in the
        exciting scientific town.
      </p>
    </div>
    <style>
      img {
        user-select: none;
      }

      .container {
        position: relative;

        display: grid;
        grid-template:
          "title title title title title title" 50%
          "line line line line . ." 0.1fr
          "logo text text text . ." 1.9fr / 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0;

        height: 100vh;

        font-size: 1.5rem;

        .hero {
          position: absolute;
          z-index: -1;
          inset: 3rem;

          padding: 3rem;
          border: 2.5px black solid;
        }

        hr {
          grid-area: line;

          width: 80%;
          height: 5px;
          border: 0;

          background: linear-gradient(to right, #e3021f, #ec8b31);
        }
      }

      .title {
        grid-area: title;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 10px;

        font-family: Gloock, serif;
        font-size: 10rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 0.75;
        text-align: center;

        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #e3021f, #ec8b31);
        background-clip: text;

        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;

        .big {
          font-size: 20rem;
        }
      }

      p {
        grid-area: text;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Sans", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .logo {
        display: flex;
        grid-area: logo;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: flex-end;

        padding: 2rem;
        padding-bottom: 6rem;

        .coins {
          display: flex;
          padding-block: 1rem;
        }

        .main-logo {
          width: 200px;
          height: auto;
        }
      }

      .erotic {
        position: absolute;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;

        /* float: right;
        shape-outside: url("/src/assets/images/erotic/elevate.png");
        shape-image-threshold: 20%;
        shape-margin: 1rem; */
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: Gloock;

        src: url("/fonts/Gloock-Regular.ttf") format("truetype");
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Sans";

        src: url("/fonts/IBMPlexSans-Light.ttf") format("truetype");
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
